get.description:
Get mapping of connection IDs to their associated tools and agents.

This endpoint retrieves all connections that have associated tools or agents (LangGraph),
grouped by connection ID. Each connection includes lists of tools and agents that use it.

Query Parameters:
    connectionIds: Optional. Comma-separated connection IDs to filter results.
                  If provided, returns data only for those specific connection IDs.
                  If omitted, returns all connections with tools or agents.
                  Example: ?connectionIds=uuid1,uuid2,uuid3

Returns:
    dict: Response containing list of connections with their associated tools and agents:
    {
        "items": [
            {
                "connection_id": "uuid",
                "tools": [
                    {
                        "tool_name": "name",
                        "tool_id": "uuid",
                        "tool_type": "openapi|python|langflow|mcp|conversational_search"
                    }
                ],
                "agents": [
                    {
                        "agent_id": "uuid",
                        "agent_name": "name",
                        "agent_type": "custom",
                        "agent_title": "title"
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
    }

Note: The agents array contains LangGraph agents (custom assistants) that use the connection.
      Both tools and agents arrays may be empty if the connection is not currently in use.

Raises:
    HTTPException: 500 if there's an error retrieving the connections mapping
